# Project core

Next.js 15 App Router · TypeScript strict · React 19 · Tailwind 4 + shadcn/ui · Drizzle · Zod · TanStack Table · Recharts.

## Access boundaries (owner rule)

| Target | Access |
|---|---|
| **pokewin-admin** | Full — edit, commit, push, deploy |
| **Admin DB** | Full — DDL/DML/migrations/ops as needed |
| **Antifraud backend** | Full — edit, deploy, operate |
| **Antifraud DB** | Full — DDL/DML/migrations/ops as needed |
| **Production / MAIN game DB** | **Read-only** — no AI writes, merges, DDL, or DML |
| **Sibling `frontend` repo** | **Read-only** — open a PR only when the owner approves in the current message |
| **Sibling `backend` repo** | **Read-only** — open a PR only when the owner approves in the current message |

PR approval for frontend/backend is per-request and does **not** authorize push/deploy to their production branches unless the owner says so separately.

## Auth

Use DAL only (`src/lib/dal.ts`): `verifySession`, `requireAdmin`, `requireRole`, `requirePageAccess`. Never bypass middleware or trust client-side checks for security.

## Dual DB

- `db` / MAIN = game data (read-only). `adminDb` / ADMIN = admin-only tables (writable).
- No cross-DB joins — query separately, merge in code.
- New table: MAIN if it could surface in the player app; ADMIN if admin-only. Prefer ADMIN when unsure.

## Verification gate

| Change | Gate |
|---|---|
| Docs / markdown | none |
| CSS / copy / static JSX | `tsc --noEmit` + `npm run lint` |
| RSC, types, routes, schema, deps | + `npm run build` |

Never start a browser, Playwright, screenshots, or the dev server for verification unless the owner asks in that message.

## Release (pokewin-admin)

- Production: Vercel `packy-admin-dashboard` · branch `main` · https://pokewin-admin.vercel.app
- Commit with `git commit --only <paths>`, never `git add -A`.
- Never commit `.env`, secrets, `src/generated/*`, or `recent-pushes.json`.

## Hotspots (don't blind-edit in parallel)

`app-sidebar.tsx` · `permissions.ts` · `admin-pages.ts` · `dal.ts` · `(admin)/layout.tsx` · `package.json` / `next.config.ts` · shared query + panel primitives · `drizzle/admin/migrations/`
